# A namespace prefix is a lowercase letter, then lowercase letters or
# digits (MC13). It is drawn as superscript letters; a prefix with a
# character that has no superscript form (q, a digit) is drawn as written.
== SOURCE
combinators:K_ 1 2; b2:m_ean 3; quux:y
== TOKENS
0..14 Func(combinators:K_)
15..16 Num(1)
17..18 Num(2)
18..19 Semi
20..28 Func(b2:m_ean)
29..30 Num(3)
30..31 Semi
32..38 Var(quux:y)
== RENDER
ᶜᵒᵐᵇⁱⁿᵃᵗᵒʳˢK̲ 1 2◆ b2:m̲ean 3◆ quux:y
